@0    = ~I wish I could tell people to do stuff the way you can. I'd get a discount everywhere I went.~
@1    = ~And this, we see, is the stellar ambition of our Faren Blacknall. A couple of gold pieces here and there when buying groceries.~
@2    = ~Hey, don't knock it. My parents taught me to be careful with my money.~
@3    = ~The way you throw it about, I would hardly think so. Still, you may as well enjoy it for a short time while you are able.~
@4    = ~Heh, that's true enough. But I've still got some saved for a rainy day.~
@5    = ~What about you? You got a stash hidden away for the future?~
@6    = ~I have been robbed so many times that I would hardly wish to shout about it even if I did.~
@7    = ~Besides, planning for the future is absurd when we have these Bhaalspawn to vanquish. Sooner or later, one of them will strike a lucky blow, and all the money in the world will not help us.~
